{
  "name": "Middleware Workvivo - Chatgpt",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "3b5a822c-9ba2-55a1-ba14-db84240579ab",
      "name": "Mensaje de Workvivo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "3f6b2d9e-8a41-4c7e-9b15-5d0e7a1c9f42",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "workvivo/validator",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5e39492a-865a-5a81-80dc-3c372064238c",
      "name": "¿Es mensaje de un usuario?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "96f8e6af-7531-43fd-a69f-57e68c138c53",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.category }}",
              "rightValue": "bot_message_notification",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "65c49657-4e94-4bee-9ffa-ac11d1adc0ed",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.app_id }}",
              "rightValue": "FD0AEB65-5E89-415B-A51B-6D76E1998671",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "eb4120da-0d92-42d8-be24-48b75d37209c",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.sender.user_id }}",
              "rightValue": "={{ $json.body.bot.bot_userid }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEquals"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "c5a42649-4cba-4959-b0d0-f010c687ebde",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.message.text }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0b55066e-c920-50d9-87da-b761b63a7520",
      "name": "Enviar a Validator",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000,
      "notes": "Reemplaza agtch_PEGAR_AQUI por el ID del canal API del agente (Agent Builder → API channel).",
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.chatgpt.com/v1/workspace_agents/agtch_PEGAR_AQUI/trigger",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpBearerAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Idempotency-Key",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.message.message_id }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ conversation_key: $json.body.channel.channel_url, input: $json.body.message.text + '\\n\\n---\\nResponder en Workvivo con: channel_url=' + $json.body.channel.channel_url + ' ; bot_userid=' + $json.body.bot.bot_userid }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "da8cb423-8d1f-565d-8e80-977c0fd0b1e6",
      "name": "Respuesta de Validator",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "e4541067-5688-537c-b898-f91f87d76568",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "workvivo/validator/respuesta",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "16c43636-ce14-531f-b4c9-5057a3bfc1ee",
      "name": "Responder en Workvivo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000,
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.workvivo.io/v1/chat/bots/message",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpBearerAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Workvivo-Id",
              "value": "1000242"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ bot_userid: $json.body.bot_userid, channel_url: $json.body.channel_url, type: 'message', message: $json.body.message }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9de00772-ea9b-580f-a6cd-1b5466de071a",
      "name": "Nota",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -340
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 760,
        "height": 300,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## Workvivo ↔ Validator (simple)\n**Ida:** Workvivo → *Mensaje de Workvivo* → filtro → *Enviar a Validator* (canal API, responde 202).\n**Vuelta:** el canal API de ChatGPT **no devuelve la respuesta** (es asíncrono). Validator la envía por POST a *Respuesta de Validator* con:\n`{ \"channel_url\": \"...\", \"bot_userid\": \"...\", \"message\": \"texto\" }` → *Responder en Workvivo*.\n\nCredenciales: **ChatGPT Validator** (Bearer, token de Workspace Agent), **Workvivo Bot API** (Bearer), **Validator → n8n** (Header Auth en el webhook de vuelta)."
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
